y addresses macroeconomic shifts, regulatory impacts, technology modernization including AI, cost management, and growth strategies in banking for 2025. This is highly relevant to the task. Score: 10\n\nCredibility: Deloitte is a highly credible global professional services firm with expertise in financial services. The article is authored by Deloitte Center for Financial Services experts. Score: 10\n\nRecency: Published 13 October 2024, which is within 1 year from the current date (19 May 2025). According to the scoring rubric, less than 1 month old = 10, greater than 3 months old = 9, greater than 6 months old = 7. October 2024 is about 7 months ago, so score: 7\n\nAccessibility: The URL is accessible and not paywalled.\n\nTotal score = 10 + 10 + 7 = 27\n\nNow I will proceed to the next URL.\n\nAction: Read a website content\nAction Input: {"website_url":"https://www.spglobal.com/market-intelligence/en/news-insights/research/key-themes-2025-banking-risk","css_element":"body"}\nObservation: \nI encountered an error while trying to use the tool. This was the error: Message: invalid session id\nStacktrace:\n0   chromedriver                        0x0000000100dc83cc cxxbridge1$str$ptr + 2829900\n1   chromedriver                        0x0000000100dc0694 cxxbridge1$str$ptr + 2797844\n2   chromedriver                        0x00000001008fde30 cxxbridge1$string$len + 89744\n3   chromedriver                        0x0000000100938858 cxxbridge1$string$len + 329912\n4   chromedriver                        0x0000000100960c28 cxxbridge1$string$len + 494728\n5   chromedriver                        0x000000010095ff30 cxxbridge1$string$len + 491408\n6   chromedriver                        0x00000001008ceb00 chromedriver + 92928\n7   chromedriver                        0x0000000100d8c7f0 cxxbridge1$str$ptr + 2585200\n8   chromedriver                        0x0000000100d8fac0 cxxbridge1$str$ptr + 2598208\n9   chromedriver                        0x0000000100d6ddc4 cxxbridge1$str$pt